  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reforcing the Production and Commercialization of Goats in the First Section of the Community of Cavaillon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock farmers in Boileau and Flamands lack access to quality animals to sustain their way of life. Organisation de Dveloppement Durable et Solidaire DHati (ODDSHA) provides training to improve the production and sale of goats for farmers in grassroots associations. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Haiti. ODDSHAs activities promote smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
